@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:architecture] porsche-domain-authority
Porsche MUST submit management actions through Marshall's verified-TLS control
WebSocket and retained HTTPS bootstrap APIs (ADR-0142). Account authority, SSH-key ownership, durable receipts and machine mutations
MUST remain in Marshall's Ash domains. Connection processes MUST NOT become
account actors or write directly to PostgreSQL or Oban.

@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:security] porsche-transport-secrets
Transport errors and inspected configuration MUST NOT expose gateway credentials,
session tokens, approval links or raw commands. Control WebSockets and retained
HTTPS requests MUST verify the configured peer and MUST NOT follow redirects,
queue while disconnected or retry implicitly.
